#: bell.cpp:228
msgid ""
"<h1>System Bell</h1> Here you can customize the sound of the standard system "
"bell, i.e. the \"beep\" you always hear when there's something wrong. Note "
"that you can further customize this sound using the \"Accessibility\" "
"control module: for example you can choose a sound file to be played instead "
"of the standard bell."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Chuo^ng he^. tho^'ng</h1> Ba.n co' the^? tuy` bie^'n a^m thanh cu?a chuo^ng "
"he^. tho^'ng chua^?n, nghi~a la` tie^'ng \"beep\" ma` ba.n va^~n thu+o+`ng nghe tha^'y khi co' lo^~i ."
"chu' y' la` ba.n co' the^? tuy` bie^'n nhie^`u ho+n nu+~a ba(`ng ca'ch du`ng module ddie^`u khie^?n \"Accessibility\""
"Cha(?ng ha.n, ba.n muo^'n cho.n 1 a^m thanh se~ ddu+o+.c cho+i thay vi` chuo^ng he^. tho^'ng ."

